A||||6||Bob Englert||NC Fiero Owners?||||1||
Z||000000||Bob Englert||11-03-2000||08:08 PM||||NC Owners and neighbors:<P>I was wondering if there is any interest among NC and nearby Fiero owners to get together sometime to meet and exchange info.<P>I have recently hooked up with another Greensboro GT owner (bhooper) that is also<BR>rebuilding the front suspension in his car.  Have met via e-mail an 88 coupe<BR>owner in Chapel Hill, someone in King with 2 cars, and a person in Winston<BR>Salem with a 86 GT that he is trying to get running again.<P>What I would like to suggest is that if anyone is interested we try to<BR>arrange to meet at a local Golden Corral in mid January.  This would give<BR>everyone time to arrange their schedules and hopefully would not interfere<BR>with football games, etc.  I would suggest a Saturday at about 2:00PM.  We could<BR>use the parking lot to look at any cars that arrive and have a nice informal<BR>lunch to talk cars.  It could be in Greensboro or elsewhere if more are from<BR>another part of the state.<P>I would also like to arrange a small run through the back roads in southern<BR>WV in the late spring.  I have some favorite roads and would like to find<BR>more so we could have a group of cars spend the day blasting around on good<BR>Fiero roads!  Something like the recent RFTH but on a smaller scale.<P>Please e-mail if interested.  <P>Thanks....<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>87 Coupe<BR>85 SE (For Sale)||||reg||1
Z||000001||bHooper||11-04-2000||08:23 AM||||Hey Bob!  It would be great to get some people together!  <P>I am all for a run in the mountains, somewhere... looking forward to putting my <B>entire</B> rebuilt suspension to the test  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> hehehehe.  There ae some excellent roads up around Jeffeson, Boone, and Valle Cruis, also.<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||zeusrekning||11-05-2000||04:13 PM||||yeah there is. I am trying to get all the guys from nc and sc to meet up next spring. <A HREF="http://www.carolinafieros.com." TARGET=_blank>www.carolinafieros.com.</A>  Nice to meet yeah.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Bob Englert||11-09-2000||10:45 PM||||Thanks to all that have responded to my question regarding a get together of<BR>NC Fiero owners.  I have gotten about 12-15 responses so far.<P>I would like to propose that we arrange to meet at a local Golden Corral<BR>steakhouse here in Greensboro (Just off I-40).  I would be happy to change<BR>the location of the majority of owners are from a different part of the<BR>state.  It depends on the responses.<P>Two questions for the group:<P>1) Would either the weekend of Dec 16/17 or January 13/14 be suitable to<BR>meet?<P>2) Would it be better to meet on Saturday or Sunday?<P><BR>Depending on the responses I will pick a day.  I would be happy to do both<BR>weekends if some cannot come on one of those selected.<P>This is not intended to be formal at all.  I would just like a chance to<BR>meet other Fiero owners in the area and see if there is any interest in<BR>doing any type of cruise in the Spring.  I would also like to be able to<BR>share and get info on maintenance and upgrades from other owners.<P><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>87 Coupe<BR>85 SE (For Sale)||||reg||1
